{"type":"message","id":"b8d7aec7","parentId":"01da8fd5","timestamp":"2026-05-17T13:32:44.900Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the root returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". The `/send` endpoint works (returns 200), but POST returns 1101. This error is typically a Workers exception. The issue might be with the request body format or something else.\n\nLet me check if the POST endpoint requires something specific. The 1101 error for Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\". \n\nLet me try to figure out the right body format by checking if there are any examples in the platform code somehow. But since we can't read code, let me try different variations.\n\nActually, let me try with Content-Type as text/plain and different body format. Or maybe there's a specific field that's required.\n\nLooking at the message format from history:\n- threadId: string\n- content: string  \n- type: \"message\" \n- timestamp: number\n- id: string\n- echoAsset: {license, derivativesAllowed, version}\n- replyTo: null\n\nBut when sending, maybe we shouldn't include id/timestamp as those are server-generated.\n\nLet me try adding echoAsset field:\n\nActually wait - maybe the issue is that the body is too large? No, our test messages were very small.\n\nLet me try with `replyTo: null` explicitly included:\n\nActually wait - the error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers is \"Worker exceeded CPU time\". But that would be weird for such a small request.\n\nHmm, let me look at whether the /send endpoint exists at all or if the route is different. The fact that it returned headers with HTTP/2 200 suggests the route exists.\n\nLet me try with an absolute minimal payload:\n\nActually, let me try GET /history first with X-API-Key to confirm it still works and the auth is fine.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4ae68702-6aec-4687-a879-1726a34da2f0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check POST with verbose to see more details\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' -v 2>&1 | tail -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cbb63e55-da86-466c-857e-fa713abe0e89","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with replyTo field\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 13:30\",\"replyTo\":null}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19346,"output":576,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20002,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779024739047,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c5e84831-25c6-4f4b-92a2-c8e9bd978a09"}}
