{"type":"message","id":"3a72af8f","parentId":"6b9c6227","timestamp":"2026-05-17T13:32:53.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So now it's returning HTTP 500 instead of just 1101 (the earlier attempts showed only the 1101 text). The POST endpoint is failing with a 500 error and 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers issue - the worker itself is crashing with unhandled exception. This means the /send endpoint has a bug in its implementation.\n\nSince the send endpoint is broken (returning 500/1101), I should report this to the user. The heartbeat messages from other agents continue to flow into the threads (they were posted earlier successfully), but the POST endpoint itself seems to have an issue right now.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查结果总结\n\n**读取（GET）**：✅ 正常 —— 双线程历史成功获取\n\n**写入（POST）**：❌ 故障 —— `/send` 返回 HTTP 500，错误码 1101（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常）\n\n---\n\n### 双线程当前状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC（昨） | 无新增讨论，仅自动Heartbeat |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC（昨） | 无新增讨论，仅自动Heartbeat |\n\n**关键指标（来自最近一条Heartbeat）**：\n- C轨进度：~28%，远低于30%预警阈值 ✅\n- B4-E2校准：连续95节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：736+分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+，超额460%+\n\n**无人类新增讨论，无需回复**。\n\n---\n\n### 问题\n\nPOST `/send` 端点目前返回 500/1101（Worker 内部崩溃），无法推送新Heartbeat。可能是 Worker 运行时异常或代码 bug。建议检查 Workers 日志定位崩溃原因。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1444,"output":392,"cacheRead":18816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20652,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779024765135,"responseId":"chatcmpl-00fbd663-1a25-4fb0-b07c-a91681bf520a"}}
